{
"id": "section-2",
"kind": "faq",
"container": "\n    <section class=\"rich-band\">\n      <div class=\"shell split\">\n        <div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Need help choosing?</span><h2>Tell us what is happening.</h2><p>Include the address or suburb, whether it is plumbing or electrical, what you can observe and any access details.</p></div>\n        <aside class=\"panel\"><h3>Ready to request a repair?</h3><p>Send your suburb and repair details. Our Perth team arranges an on-site assessment and confirms the repair plan and written quote.</p><a class=\"button\" href=\"contact.html\">Request a repair</a></aside>\n      </div>\n    <!-- site-intent:start --><div class=\"intent-content shell text-column\" data-site-intent><h2>Choose the property location, then the service</h2><p>The six regional guides organise the existing Perth suburb directory. They do not represent six separate shopfronts or confirm a dispatch time. Pair the address with the actual repair request so access, scope and availability can be checked together. Mandurah and Peel are not automatically included by the research table; ask about an address outside the listed directory.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"plumbing.html\">Find the plumbing service</a></li><li><a href=\"electrical.html\">Find the electrical service</a></li><li><a href=\"contact.html\">Confirm an address and proposed work</a></li></ul><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:0:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:0:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:1:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:1:answer}}</details></div><!-- site-intent:end --></section>" as TrustedHtml,
"items": [
{
"question": "Does selecting a suburb confirm an appointment?",
"answer": "<p>No. A suburb link prefills the property field in the enquiry form. The team still needs to agree the visit, work scope and access with you.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Is there a local office in every listed suburb?",
"answer": "<p>No. A service-area listing is a way to organise enquiries, not a claim that Ellis has premises in each suburb. The Perth office and its contact details are listed separately.</p>" as TrustedHtml
}
]
},
{
"id": "section-3",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n  <section class=\"section\" data-content-hub><div class=\"shell text-column\"><h2>Plumbing and electrical repairs across six Perth regions</h2><p>Choose the region for the property that needs work, then use a suburb link to prefill the repair form. The guides cover CBD and Inner Perth, Northern, Southern, Eastern and Western Suburbs, plus Perth Hills and Swan Valley. The suburb search is a booking shortcut; it does not confirm an appointment or arrival time.</p><h3>Choose the service as well as the location</h3><p>For plumbing, start with <a href=\"blocked-drains-perth.html\">blocked drains</a>, <a href=\"water-leak-detection-perth.html\">water leak detection</a> or <a href=\"hot-water-problems-perth.html\">hot-water repairs</a>. For electrical work, see <a href=\"power-faults-perth.html\">electrical fault finding</a> or <a href=\"lighting-power-points-perth.html\">lighting and power points</a>. These pages explain the assessment and quote for the task. The regional guide adds information about arranging the visit.</p><h3>Arrange access and approval</h3><p>For an apartment, include the unit and building name, on-site contact and any concierge, lift or parking arrangements. For other premises, explain how the team can reach the relevant room or equipment. Tell us about restricted access without entering a hazardous area to inspect it. For a rental or strata property, identify who can approve the work; providing entry does not automatically authorise repair costs.</p><p>If your suburb is not listed, <a href=\"contact.html\">contact the Perth team</a> with the address and requested work to confirm coverage and availability. Start with what you can observe; you do not need a diagnosis or photos. The assessment and written quote establish the agreed repair scope, access requirements and any separate restoration work.</p></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
}
],
